{"type":"text","timestamp":1791297611276,"sessionID":"ses_eee5c265cffeSgzc4WoZm0B5tl","part":{"id":"prt_111a86441001d5WfEMgUrFIBTB","messageID":"msg_111a82d17001KcELAaHmNPJpRA","sessionID":"ses_eee5c265cffeSgzc4WoZm0B5tl","type":"text","text":"All 6 tests pass now.\n\nI fixed the following bugs:\n- format_cents used floor division on negative cents. It now formats the absolute value with the sign.\n- parse_date returned (year, day, month). It now returns (year, month, day).\n- top_items sorted totals ascending. It now sorts totals descending, with name ascending for ties.\n- parse_amount stripped signs and symbols incorrectly. It now handles spaces and the $-sign order.","time":{"start":1791297610817,"end":1791297611260}}}
